{"id":"1165db05a0a23506","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-bpp-amplification.md","title":"BPP Error Amplification","display":"thm-bpp-amplification — BPP Error Amplification","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-bpp-amplification","aliases":["28-thm-bpp-amplification","BPP Error Reduction"],"display":"thm-bpp-amplification — BPP Error Amplification","depends_on":["[[28-df-bpp]]","[[28-thm-chernoff-bound]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 7.10 and §7.4.1; printed pp.132–133; PDF pp.158–159","source_printed_pages":"132–133","source_pdf_pages":"158–159","source_status":"statement-checked","proof_status":"source-proof-not-fully-audited; local-proof-reviewed","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"verification_status":"proved-in-note; R7","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-bpp-amplification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-bpp-amplification</span><span>BPP Error Reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bpp-amplification — BPP Error Amplification"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"43f749607d4825d4\" href=\"?note=43f749607d4825d4\" title=\"28-thm-chernoff-bound\">28-thm-chernoff-bound</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 7.10 and §7.4.1; printed pp.132–133; PDF pp.158–159"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"132–133"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"158–159"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source-proof-not-fully-audited; local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; R7"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\">\\(L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,a,b,c\">\\(M,a,b,c\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a> 的见证，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(n)=c(n+1)^b\">\\(q(n)=c(n+1)^b\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L\">\\(\\chi_L\\)</span> 为语言特征函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 为奇数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_1,\\ldots,r_t\">\\(r_1,\\ldots,r_t\\)</span> 独立均匀于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}^{q(|x|)}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}^{q(|x|)}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_E\">\\(\\mathbf1_E\\)</span> 为事件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的指示比特。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^{(t)}\">\\(M^{(t)}\\)</span> 为下面定义的独立重复多数算法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 是所需误差指数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j^{\\otimes t}\">\\(U_j^{\\otimes t}\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 个独立 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 的乘积分布。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M^{(t)}(x;r_1,\\ldots,r_t)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\{\\sum_{i=1}^tM(x;r_i)&gt;t/2\\}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M^{(t)}(x;r_1,\\ldots,r_t)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\{\\sum_{i=1}^tM(x;r_i)&gt;t/2\\}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr_{(r_1,\\ldots,r_t)\\leftarrow U_{q(|x|)}^{\\otimes t}}[M^{(t)}(x;r_1,\\ldots,r_t)\\ne\\chi_L(x)]\\le\\exp(-t/48).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr_{(r_1,\\ldots,r_t)\\leftarrow U_{q(|x|)}^{\\otimes t}}[M^{(t)}(x;r_1,\\ldots,r_t)\\ne\\chi_L(x)]\\le\\exp(-t/48).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\Pr_{(r_1,\\ldots,r_{48k+1})\\leftarrow U_{q(|x|)}^{\\otimes(48k+1)}}[M^{(48k+1)}(x;r_1,\\ldots,r_{48k+1})\\ne\\chi_L(x)]\\le2^{-k}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\Pr_{(r_1,\\ldots,r_{48k+1})\\leftarrow U_{q(|x|)}^{\\otimes(48k+1)}}[M^{(48k+1)}(x;r_1,\\ldots,r_{48k+1})\\ne\\chi_L(x)]\\le2^{-k}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 历史证据边界：当时本地常数推导已复核，但上游一般 Chernoff 尾界的矩母函数证明未完整独立审计，故当时不作为已完整核验的证明依赖。R7 已另行完成 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"43f749607d4825d4\" href=\"?note=43f749607d4825d4\" title=\"28-thm-chernoff-bound\">28-thm-chernoff-bound</a> 中有限独立比特的局部证明，以下有限放大推导因而有完整的本地证明依据；原书更一般的逆多项式优势放大证明仍未在本条独立审计。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为正确次数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu=\\mathbb ES\\ge2t/3\">\\(\\mu=\\mathbb ES\\ge2t/3\\)</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t/2\\le3\\mu/4\">\\(t/2\\le3\\mu/4\\)</span>，错误事件包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{S\\le3\\mu/4\\}\">\\(\\{S\\le3\\mu/4\\}\\)</span>；已核对的 Chernoff 下尾以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta=1/4\">\\(\\delta=1/4\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[\\text{错误}]\\le e^{-\\mu/32}\\le e^{-t/48}\">\\(\\Pr[\\text{错误}]\\le e^{-\\mu/32}\\le e^{-t/48}\\)</span>。使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"48k+1\">\\(48k+1\\)</span> 次重复得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^{-k-1/48}\\le2^{-k}\">\\(e^{-k-1/48}\\le2^{-k}\\)</span>。重复数为奇数，消除原稿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ck\">\\(ck\\)</span> 的平票约定缺口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 取输入长度的多项式时仍为 PPT。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-bpp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-chernoff-bound","status":"resolved","id":"43f749607d4825d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-chernoff-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}$，$M,a,b,c$ 是 [[28-df-bpp]] 的见证，$q(n)=c(n+1)^b$；$\\chi_L$ 为语言特征函数。","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-chernoff-bound","status":"resolved","id":"43f749607d4825d4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"R6 历史证据边界：当时本地常数推导已复核，但上游一般 Chernoff 尾界的矩母函数证明未完整独立审计，故当时不作为已完整核验的证明依赖。R7 已另行完成 [[28-thm-chernoff-bound]] 中有限独立比特的局部证明，以下有限放大推导因而有完整的本地证明依据；原书更一般的逆多项式优势放大证明仍未在本条独立审计。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}","display":false},{"tex":"M,a,b,c","display":false},{"tex":"q(n)=c(n+1)^b","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_L","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"r_1,\\ldots,r_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}^{q(|x|)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_E","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"M^{(t)}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"U_j^{\\otimes t}","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"M^{(t)}(x;r_1,\\ldots,r_t)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\{\\sum_{i=1}^tM(x;r_i)>t/2\\}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pr_{(r_1,\\ldots,r_t)\\leftarrow U_{q(|x|)}^{\\otimes t}}[M^{(t)}(x;r_1,\\ldots,r_t)\\ne\\chi_L(x)]\\le\\exp(-t/48).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\Pr_{(r_1,\\ldots,r_{48k+1})\\leftarrow U_{q(|x|)}^{\\otimes(48k+1)}}[M^{(48k+1)}(x;r_1,\\ldots,r_{48k+1})\\ne\\chi_L(x)]\\le2^{-k}.","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu=\\mathbb ES\\ge2t/3","display":false},{"tex":"t/2\\le3\\mu/4","display":false},{"tex":"\\{S\\le3\\mu/4\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta=1/4","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr[\\text{错误}]\\le e^{-\\mu/32}\\le e^{-t/48}","display":false},{"tex":"48k+1","display":false},{"tex":"e^{-k-1/48}\\le2^{-k}","display":false},{"tex":"ck","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":2417,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"放大与集中：[[28-thm-bpp-amplification]]、[[28-thm-chernoff-bound]]、[[28-thm-bpp-closure]]。"},{"id":"c8ba441dc36f60de","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A$ 是由 [[28-thm-bpp-amplification]] 对该语言机器独立重复得到的确定型随机带算法，使用 $m(n)$ 个随机位；$m$ 为多项式有界。放大后每个 $n$ 位输入错误概率至多 $2^{-(n+1)}$。"},{"id":"1392e4ae6d9e4b1c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取补直接翻转输出。先用 [[28-thm-bpp-amplification]] 取 $k=3$、分别独立重复 $145$ 次，将两个错误分别降到 $1/8$，再对输出取 OR 或 AND；任一算法出错的并合概率至多 $1/4<1/3$。补闭性在定理 7.15 证明中使用，另外两项由上述本地推导。"},{"id":"08022e9739f16906","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，$L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}$，见 [[28-df-bpp]]；$M$ 是经 [[28-thm-bpp-amplification]] 放大的确定型随机带机器，$n=|x|$，使用 $m(n)$ 个随机位。"}],"outgoing":["073a1a66749fa84e","43f749607d4825d4"]}